<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan refined lead output up 3.5 pct y/y--MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan refined lead output up 3.5 pct y/y--MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese refined lead output in January rose 3.5 percent from the same month last year to 19,674 tonnes, according to preliminary Ministry of International Trade and Industry data released on Thursday.</p>
<p>The MITI data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		    Jan 96   yr/yr change   Dec 96</p>
<p> Output	   19,674     +3.5 pct     20,196</p>
<p> Shipments	18,618    +14.3 pct     18,909</p>
<p> Stocks	   14,809    -10.7 pct     14,145</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
